<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's TAM 1996 net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's TAM 1996 net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian carrier Transportes Aereos Regionais S/A TAM issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>		  1996			 1995</p>
<p>    shr	   12.22 reais		9.42 reais</p>
<p>    net	   57 million		     43.9 million</p>
<p>    rvs	   503 million		    369.2 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All data in Brazilian reais. Share profit figures provided per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>(( -- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
